  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 201.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to set forth the procedures that will be used in the proceedings of the New Hampshire waste management council.\n\nSource. #4846, eff 6-21-90, EXPIRED: 6-21-96\n\nNew. #6334, eff 9-20-96; ss by #8031, eff 1-24-04",
